=2 Walkthrough
* Travel to {z:Sih Gates} or {z:Moh Gates} and locate an {p:Ergon Locus}

[Ergon Loci
|^Name|Zone|Position|XP|Notes
|Prominence of the Gales|{z:Sih Gates}|J-11|1000|Requires Key Item {k:"Watercrafting"}. Use the Frontier Station Waypoint to go to {z:Foret de Hennetiel}, then take the nearest entrance into {z:Sih Gates}. Hug the right wall until you come to a castoff point.
|Lake of Light|{z:Sih Gates}|K-7|1250|There is a {p:Colonization Reive} on the way. Bring {@i:Silent Oil|4165} {i:Silent Oil|Silent Oil|4165} and {@i:Prism Powder|4164} {i:Prism Powder|Prism Powder|4164}, as the area has a very large amount of Apex mobs.
|Sweltering Spring|{z:Moh Gates}|K-6|1250|Enter from {z:Morimar Basalt Fields} (Frontier Station Warp). There is a {p:Colonization Reive} on the way.
|Prominence of the Flames|{z:Moh Gates}|K-10|1500|Requires Key Item {k:"Climbing"}. Enter from {z:Yahse Hunting Grounds} (H-5) (Bivouac #2 Warp). Beware of True Hearing {m:Cave Panopts|Panopt} on the way.

]
